<title>LATVIA: All yields up at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>All yields up at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Treasury bill yields rose at an auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YLD  LAST  NO OF BANKS     ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One-month   3.92   3.32	3		0.5   0.6  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month 4.26   4.08	2		0.7   0.45 0.45</p>
<p> Six-month   4.6    4.02	5		2.0   2.35 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
